      "content": "1777/0/10011 18-FEB-02 NORTHCHURCH Rossway Home Farm Stable Block GV II Stable block, now residence.  C18 with C19 additions.  Red brick with some burned bricks.  Slate hipped roof. One long range with round-headed sashes to ground floor, and 8/8 sashes to first floor.  Central wood belfy and clocktower. Lower perpendicularly attached range in brown brick with hipped roof, and full-height central opening under pitched roof with flanking segmental-arched windows. Group value with 1860s Rossway."
    }
